# Training run log

`TRAINING_RUN_LOG.md` (repo root) is a concise, one-row-per-job table of every
Slurm training job: Job ID, Run ID, submitted time, why it was started, end
time/status, and why it stopped.

Whenever you `sbatch` a new training job or `scancel` an existing one, add or
update its row in the same turn — one concise sentence per "why" cell, no
long explanations. Don't wait to be asked.
